00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:50.833
I believe it.

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:52.210
Not a good look.

00:00:52.210 --> 00:00:53.120
Is there any chance,

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.750
because I've watched the show with my wife

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:56.583
and it's very interesting

00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:59.330
